# Naming

`docs/` is the specification and it wins every argument. Read the module's section in `docs/03_MODULES_AND_SCREENS.md` before designing a screen; screens are specified column by column, including default filters.

## The vocabulary

| Term | Means |
| --- | --- |
| Platform Owner | Runs QuickerPay itself, sells to Tenants, sees no tenant financial data |
| Tenant | One customer of QuickerPay, one isolated database |
| Super Admin | Owns a Tenant |
| Banker | Holds banking inside a Tenant, earns commission. Stored `users.role = BANKER`. Ledger `BANKER_BALANCE:<id>` |
| Admin | Super Admin helper. Stored `users.role = ADMIN`; menus only, no banking |
| Operator | Works a subset of a Banker's banking |
| Auditor | Read-only across the Tenant |
| Merchant (storage) / Exchange Master (UI) | The Super Admin's customer; table `merchants`, UI label Exchange Master |

There is no nesting. A Tenant cannot contain a Tenant, and a Banker cannot contain a Banker.

## Banned words

Each of these names a concept this product deliberately does not have. Using one is a bug, not a style choice.

**Display exception:** UI may say **Exchange Master** for merchants. Do not invent nested agencies. Do not store banking owners as `ADMIN` — that role is the SA helper only.

```text
Provider, P2P Provider, Agency        -> Tenant
Agency Admin                          -> BANKER (UI: Banker)
Agency Super Admin                    -> Super Admin
Platform Super Admin                  -> Platform Owner
Master Agency, Sub Agency, Nested     -> do not exist
Wallet                                -> does not exist, balances derive from the ledger
client                                -> Tenant, or Merchant
provider_id                           -> tenant_id, or owner_user_id inside a tenant
bank_id                               -> bank_account_id
VISIONPAY_CONFIG                      -> QUICKERPAY_CONFIG
bankerCode                            -> username
bankerUPI, banker_UPI                 -> upiAddress
VisonPay, VisionPay                   -> QuickerPay
STAFF_ADMIN                           -> ADMIN (SA helper)
users.role ADMIN (banking)            -> BANKER
ADMIN_BALANCE                         -> BANKER_BALANCE
```

`BOT` is not banned. It is the label the UTR Entries screen renders for an extension-created row, derived from `utr_entries.source`, never stored as a username.

## Field name suffixes

These suffixes are load-bearing. A money field without `_minor` and a rate without `_bp` will eventually be read as rupees or as a percentage by someone in a hurry.

- `_minor` — integer minor units, paise, `BIGINT`
- `_bp` — integer basis points, 3.5% is `350`
- `_masked` — already redacted server-side, safe to display
- `_at` — `TIMESTAMPTZ`
- `_by` — a `users.id`, the actor
